# Integration tests — full endpoint tests using Supertest + a test database

# What belongs here:
# - POST /api/logs — valid, invalid body, unauthenticated, wrong user
# - GET /api/auth/me — authenticated and not authenticated
# - Ownership checks: user A cannot read user B's logs

# These tests need a real (but throwaway) Postgres database.
# In CI, a Postgres service container is used. Locally, use the dev Supabase DB
# or a local Postgres instance. Never run integration tests against prod.
